<title>USA: SubMicron names interim chairman.</title>
<headline>SubMicron names interim chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SubMicron Systems Corp said Tuesday it named David Ferran interim chairman, replacing David Levy, who retired.</p>
<p>Ferran is SubMicron's president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said it hopes to have a new chairman in place by the end of the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
